<section id="items" class="lab-panel" aria-labelledby="items-heading" hidden>
  <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / COMPARE</p><h2 id="items-heading">Find where an item pulls ahead.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="#build">Back to build →</a></div>
  <p>Compare growth curves from the selected game snapshot, or swap each candidate into your current build. Level 1 has no level-up growth.</p>
  <form data-graphs-form class="lab-settings">
    <label>Compare<select name="source"><option value="items">Equipment</option><option value="builds">Saved builds</option></select></label>
    <label>Equipment category<select name="category"><option value="weapon">Weapons</option><option value="armor">Armor &amp; shields</option><option value="ring">Rings</option></select></label>
    <label>Context<select name="context"><option value="standalone">Item contribution alone</option><option value="swap">Swap into current build</option></select></label>
    <label>Graph stat<select name="stat"><option value="attack">ATK</option><option value="defense">DEF</option><option value="hp">HP</option><option value="str">STR</option><option value="vit">VIT</option><option value="spd">SPD</option><option value="luk">LUK</option><option value="score">Weighted score</option></select></label>
    <label>First character level<input name="start" type="number" min="1" max="10000" value="1" required /></label>
    <label>Last character level<input name="end" type="number" min="1" max="10000" value="50" required /></label>
    <label>Table level<input name="tableLevel" type="number" min="1" max="10000" value="50" required /></label>
    <label>Find item / preset<input name="query" type="search" placeholder="Name or game ID" /></label>
  </form>
  <details class="lab-details"><summary>Comparison conditions and score weights</summary><div class="lab-settings" data-graph-conditions>
    <label>Upgrade<input name="upgrade" type="number" min="0" max="1000000000" value="0" /></label>
    <label>Corrosion<input name="corrosion" type="number" min="0" max="10000000" value="0" /></label>
    <label>Analysis<input name="analysis" type="number" min="1" max="25" value="1" /></label>
    <label>HP weight<input name="weightHP" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" value="0" /></label>
    <label>ATK weight<input name="weightATK" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" value="0.5" /></label>
    <label>DEF weight<input name="weightDEF" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" value="0.5" /></label>
  </div><p class="small-note">Standalone compares intrinsic contributions and weapon/shield power at these conditions. Swap mode uses your current piece’s upgrades, abilities and analysis, and recalculates sets/mastery. Weighted score = floor(HP × HP weight + ATK × ATK weight + DEF × DEF weight); it is not a dungeon ranking.</p></details>
  <p data-graph-status role="status" class="lab-status"></p>
  <div class="chart-panel"><div data-item-chart></div><p data-chart-readout role="status" class="chart-readout">Point at the graph or use the left/right arrow keys to inspect a level.</p><div data-chart-legend class="chart-legend"></div></div>
  <div class="lab-toolbar"><p>Select up to eight curves in the table.</p><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-export-comparison>Export table CSV</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-export-graph>Download graph SVG</button></div>
  <div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0"><table class="comparison-table"><caption data-comparison-caption>Equipment comparison</caption><thead><tr><th>Graph</th><th>Item / build</th><th>HP</th><th>ATK</th><th>DEF</th><th>SPD</th><th>Score</th><th>Use</th></tr></thead><tbody data-comparison-rows></tbody></table></div>
</section>
